# Business cards (`assets/business-card/`)

Whenever you change the business card design (copy, layout, phone, email, language):

1. Update `build-svg.mjs` (source of truth).
2. Run `node assets/business-card/build-svg.mjs` — it writes **both SVG and JPG**.
3. Never update only the SVG or only AI preview JPGs; the script must regenerate JPGs from the SVG.

Print handoff: PDF preferred; JPG from this script is 96×56 mm at 300 dpi.
